────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
RESPONSIBLE USE GUIDELINES
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This software is provided for educational and defensive security purposes.
By using this software, you agree to the following guidelines:

PERMITTED USE
  - Auditing firewall rulesets on systems you own
  - Auditing firewall rulesets on systems you have explicit written permission
    to test (e.g., as part of a penetration testing engagement or security audit)
  - Educational use, research, and learning about firewall architecture
  - Integration into internal security tooling for your own organisation

PROHIBITED USE
  - Analysing firewall configurations on systems you do not own or are not
    authorised to assess
  - Using analysis results to plan or facilitate unauthorised access to systems
  - Circumventing security controls in violation of applicable laws or policies

DISCLAIMER
  Security findings produced by this tool are heuristic approximations.
  They do not constitute legal advice, professional security consulting,
  or a guarantee of security. Always validate findings manually and test
  rule changes in a non-production environment before applying them.

  The authors and contributors of this software accept no responsibility for
  damages arising from the use or misuse of this tool.
